<report>
<title>Wilcoxon's signed ranks test</title>

<p><in>sample_1</in> vs. <in>sample_2</in><br />
Number of non-zero differences ranked = <in>non_0</in><br />
<in>sum</in></p>

<p><in>stats</in><br />
<pval>Lower side <inp>p_l</inp></pval>  (H<sub>1</sub>: differences tend to be less than zero)<br />
<pval>Upper side <inp>p_u</inp></pval>  (H<sub>1</sub>: differences tend to be greater than zero)<br />
<pval>Two sided <inp>p_2</inp></pval>  (H<sub>1</sub>: differences tend not to be zero)</p>
<block name="noconf">

<p>confidence interval not calculated if n &lt; 4</p>
</block>
<block name="conf">

<p><ci><in>pc</in></ci><br />
Median difference = <in>med_diff</in> (<ci><in>from</in> to <in>to</in></ci>)</p>
</block>
</report>
